 lost while GPIO6 is high;\nwith LED1's 15 pF input, tau = 5 ns against the 220 ns shortest pulse." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8fd76a06-c06b-49ce-9561-87417d47276c")) (text "P1-P3: wire pads on the back, right half (local u 2.3-5.0; D-065).\n3 x AWG30 PTFE to D1 J6 (Sensor AD): P1 -> pin 1 (3V3), P2 -> pin 2 (GND), P3 -> pin 3 (GPIO6)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d21cc20e-f8e8-4428-b1ad-50fd5614d919")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
